{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1342940-lifespan-merits-and-life-expectancy","id":1342940,"title":"Lifespan Merits and Life Expectancy?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-22T07:37:01-07:00","id":1342940,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Lifespan Merits and Life Expectancy?","content":"So, all of the Unaging or other Lifespan merits claim that the average human lifespan is 40 years, so you add 50% that would make it 60. Except... In the real world, the average human lifespan is 80 or so... not 40! So, what's the deal with the World of Darkness books having humans having half the lifespan? Remember, this would not take into account being killed, it would only take into account death from old age which is what the merit(s) would extend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8251-absolutgrndzer0","name":"AbsolutGrndZer0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8251_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T08:08:01-07:00","id":1342946,"title":"","content":"It would help if you gave a reference, can't bring one to mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T09:29:38-07:00","id":1342957,"title":"","content":"Also is this actually a Chronicles thing or is this actually a World thing?<br /> <br /> Cause World of Darkness starts shaving number just for it's own brand of bleak, so that might be part of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T18:24:01-07:00","id":1343063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1342940-lifespan-merits-and-life-expectancy?p=1342957#post1342957\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also is this actually a Chronicles thing or is this actually a World thing?<br /> <br /> Cause World of Darkness starts shaving number just for it's own brand of bleak, so that might be part of it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unaging is an Ascension Merit, so this should probably be moved to World.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T18:47:54-07:00","id":1343070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1342940-lifespan-merits-and-life-expectancy?p=1343063#post1343063\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Unaging is an Ascension Merit, so this should probably be moved to World.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Grand Irony, then, was that this was originally a World post. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T03:47:13-07:00","id":1343118,"title":"","content":"No, I am talking NEW World, as in Chronicles... Just one example, from Skinchangers (which is NWoD 1st edition, but still) and I can find others.<br /> <br /> Long Life (\u2022 or \u2022\u2022)<br /> Some aspect of the skinthief\u2019s transformation from<br /> mortal to supernatural has extended her normal lifespan.<br /> She may cease to age, appear to be ageless or even age<br /> beyond comprehensibility, but the effect is the same. For<br /> one point, this Aspect adds 50% to the skinthief\u2019s lifespan<br /> (about 40 years for the average human); two points double<br /> her allotted \u201cnatural\u201d term.<br /> Adding this Aspect to a character who has already<br /> used most of her extended lifespan is really a matter of<br /> color, and might, at the Storyteller\u2019s discretion, be allowed<br /> at no cost.<br /> <br /> I could go through all the books and find the other cases, but lately NWoD/CoD books are all I use now, so it's definitely CoD that I am talking about here.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT: Although, I think I may have just realized that it's the wording... is that saying that it would add 40 years for the average human? They are going ahead and doing the math based on an 80 average, not saying the average is 40? LOL","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8251,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8251-absolutgrndzer0","user":"AbsolutGrndZer0","date":". 10-23-2019, 06:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8251-absolutgrndzer0","name":"AbsolutGrndZer0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8251_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T07:25:54-07:00","id":1343167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AbsolutGrndZer0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1342940-lifespan-merits-and-life-expectancy?p=1343118#post1343118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, I am talking NEW World, as in Chronicles... Just one example, from Skinchangers (which is NWoD 1st edition, but still) and I can find others.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, well your first example was an Ascension merit which is not Chronicles. There's no merit by the name of Unaging in Chronicles.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AbsolutGrndZer0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1342940-lifespan-merits-and-life-expectancy?p=1343118#post1343118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> is that saying that it would add 40 years for the average human? They are going ahead and doing the math based on an 80 average, not saying the average is 40? LOL</div> </div> </div> </div>That's correct.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T12:00:25-07:00","id":1343235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AbsolutGrndZer0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1342940-lifespan-merits-and-life-expectancy?p=1343118#post1343118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">EDIT: Although, I think I may have just realized that it's the wording... is that saying that it would add 40 years for the average human? They are going ahead and doing the math based on an 80 average, not saying the average is 40? LOL</div> </div> </div> </div>That's my reading, yeah.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T09:58:30-07:00","id":1343450,"title":"","content":"Couple of things to step back and consider:<br /> <br /> 1. Is my game going to skip through time and interact with characters who are truly unaging as a matter of course?<br /> 2. Are my players interested only in following their single characters or are they willing to &quot;reroll&quot; through generational play?<br /> 3. Do I really want to kill off characters from old age--is that important to the story?<br /> <br /> If you've answered &quot;yes, single, no&quot; then hand out situations that supernaturally change the PCs, charge them an XP or two for Merit points, and call it a day. Use the supernatural circumstances as plot points and foils later on, while enjoying all the complication drawbacks of unaging characters.<br /> <br /> This doesn't have to be something to agonize over. It's not like &quot;old age resistance&quot; is a stat to roll, nor are there forced aging penalties. Do what is going to be fun for your story!<br /> <br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}